      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like-particle vaccines have prevented infection, precancerous disease, and cancer on a global public-health scale.",
        "attribution": "Frazer, Lowy, and Schiller represent pivotal complementary work connecting HPV capsid biology to a practical preventive vaccine.",
        "maturity": "Large-scale implementation and long follow-up provide compelling evidence of durable preventive effect.",
        "uncertainties": [
