        "Masashi Yanagisawa",
        "Luis de Lecea",
        "Emmanuel Mignot"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Orexin signaling supplied a unifying physiological explanation for stable wakefulness and a compelling mechanism for narcolepsy.",
        "attribution": "Yanagisawa and de Lecea made the foundational peptide discoveries, and Mignot established the decisive disease connection.",
        "maturity": "Genetic, circuit, physiological, and clinical evidence has converged over more than two decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The simultaneous independent discovery and the roles of additional investigators complicate strict priority."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
